    "description": "Converted from scene_tree.json (机房201, DataRoom201) by tools/scene_tree_to_cfdproj.py. No measured loads in the source: server power = room ratedPowerKw 1398 kW shared per occupied U (518.0 W/U, synthetic design load); server airflow from a 12 K rise; in-row ACUs supply 20 C through 0.50 x 1.95 m grilles (50/150 mm frame, assumed) and each hot aisle's ACUs draw its servers' airflow (synthetic). | 2026-11-16: mesh defaults = the full-patch recipe (meshBaseSize 0.3556 m = 8U on the slot-aligned background, rackRegionLevel 2, coarsePatchPreserving; about 4.7 M cells, every patch kept; the former 0.25 m gave about 11 M).",
